  "kind": "model-free-controller-credential-lifecycle",
  "problem": "A bound controller's default representation included its credential environment, and the controller did not explicitly release the binding.",
  "changes": [
    "Controller representations omit the credential environment.",
    "A scoped lease owns the selected credential entry without changing the caller's source.",
    "The controller closes the lease after CLI execution, before collection and grading.",
    "The lease also closes on setup failure, execution failure and cancellation."
  ],
